[{"text": "I now give the floor to his excellency", "start": 1.439, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Ahmed Ataf, Minister of State, Minister", "start": 3.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "for Foreign Affairs, National Community", "start": 6.4, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "Abroad and African Affairs of Algeria.", "start": 8.88, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "in the name of God the most gracious,", "start": 37.68, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "the most merciful. Mr. President,", "start": 40.0, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "I begin my statement in this general", "start": 44.559, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "debate", "start": 48.16, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "by extending my sincere congratulations", "start": 50.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "to the sister People's Republic of", "start": 54.48, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "Bangladesh", "start": 56.079, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "on the election of one of its", "start": 57.76, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "distinguished sons, Mr. Khalil Rahman", "start": 60.079, "duration": 10.72}, {"text": "as president of our general assembly.", "start": 65.68, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "I would also like to express my profound", "start": 70.799, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "gratitude and great appreciation to Mr.", "start": 73.84, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Antonio Guterish", "start": 77.2, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "who is joining us in what is the final", "start": 79.68, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "session of this assembly", "start": 84.32, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "during his tenure as secretary general", "start": 86.96, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "of the United Nations.", "start": 89.68, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "I renew our sincere appreciation and", "start": 93.439, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "recognition for all that he has done", "start": 97.119, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "throughout his two terms. He stood firm", "start": 100.159, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "in defending our organization", "start": 102.479, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "against attempts to undermine its", "start": 106.799, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "foundations.", "start": 109.36, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "He worked tirelessly to strengthen its", "start": 111.759, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "role whenever efforts were made to", "start": 115.04, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "diminish it. He devoted himself to", "start": 118.56, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "keeping the voice of multilateral action", "start": 122.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "strong", "start": 125.439, "duration": 4.001}, {"text": "whenever attempts were made to silence", "start": 127.2, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "it. Today we meet", "start": 129.44, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "at a crossroads.", "start": 133.599, "duration": 3.401}, {"text": "In many parts of the world,", "start": 137.12, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "tensions are rising,", "start": 141.599, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "conflicts are expanding,", "start": 145.12, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "and crises are deepening.", "start": 147.52, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Meanwhile,", "start": 150.319, "duration": 6.121}, {"text": "trust among nations is declining.", "start": 151.92, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "Isolationism", "start": 156.64, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "and polarization are intensifying,", "start": 158.64, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "whereas selfishness and exclusion are", "start": 163.36, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "prevailing at the expense of", "start": 165.519, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 166.879, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "Unilateral coercive measures are", "start": 169.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "increasingly being imposed", "start": 172.16, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and the logic of power is once again", "start": 175.28, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "reasserting itself, eclipsing the", "start": 179.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "virtues of dialogue and disregarding the", "start": 181.44, "duration": 9.36}, {"text": "benefits of consensus and understanding.", "start": 184.959, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "In such a turbulent international", "start": 190.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "context, the danger lies not only in the", "start": 193.28, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "outbreak of wars but also in the", "start": 196.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "normalization and acceptance of war", "start": 199.04, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "itself.", "start": 202.8, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "It lies in the transformation of the", "start": 204.64, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "exception into the rule", "start": 207.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "to a situation where the rules of", "start": 210.08, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "international law become applicable at", "start": 211.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "times and suspended at others subject", "start": 213.92, "duration": 9.239}, {"text": "only to the dictates of power balances.", "start": 217.04, "duration": 6.119}, {"text": "What sort of international order can", "start": 225.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "function properly when principles are", "start": 228.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "selected according to the identity of", "start": 231.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "those who violate them?", "start": 235.36, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "What confidence can remain in", "start": 237.92, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "international law when the aggressor", "start": 240.319, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "is granted the right to self-defense", "start": 243.84, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "while the victim is required to justify", "start": 246.56, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "even the right to survive?", "start": 251.36, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "And what future", "start": 254.799, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "await humanity", "start": 258.079, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "if imposing fate complete", "start": 262.079, "duration": 4.921}, {"text": "and", "start": 267.28, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "once again becomes a tool for managing", "start": 269.36, "duration": 7.559}, {"text": "conflict or determining their outcome.", "start": 271.52, "duration": 5.399}, {"text": "This matter is not simply a temporary", "start": 277.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "crisis facing the international system.", "start": 281.199, "duration": 6.041}, {"text": "Rather,", "start": 284.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "it is a profound review of our", "start": 287.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "collective conscience", "start": 290.16, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "and our capacity to preserve and develop", "start": 292.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "the order we established after two world", "start": 295.199, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "wars so that future generations would", "start": 297.68, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "not suffer the scourge of war.", "start": 300.8, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "Because we failed to learn the lessons", "start": 305.04, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "of a notsodistant history and because we", "start": 307.039, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "did not heed these lessons and we did", "start": 310.479, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "not transform them into measures", "start": 312.4, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "that would protect us from the", "start": 316.72, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "catastrophes of the past finally and", "start": 319.039, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "in full. And because we built a system", "start": 323.28, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "of international relations whose central", "start": 326.56, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "purpose", "start": 329.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "was to reject war", "start": 331.36, "duration": 8.559}, {"text": "and to safeguard a lasting peace, but", "start": 335.12, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "without providing this system with the", "start": 339.919, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "means and instruments necessary to", "start": 342.479, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "achieve an ambition of this size.", "start": 344.08, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "For this reason, the theme that was uh", "start": 347.759, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "chosen by the president of our general", "start": 350.88, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "assembly for this session,", "start": 353.12, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "namely", "start": 355.919, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "restoring trust", "start": 357.68, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "and managing transformation,", "start": 359.919, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "a United Nations delivering results for", "start": 362.4, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "all. This theme not only reflects the", "start": 364.96, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "challenges of our time, but also", "start": 368.88, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "presents us with a fundamental question.", "start": 371.84, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "How do we restore confidence in an", "start": 376.319, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "international system", "start": 379.28, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "whose rules and institutions have lost", "start": 381.52, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "credibility?", "start": 384.479, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "Algeria", "start": 386.96, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "believes that the starting point", "start": 388.56, "duration": 6.359}, {"text": "must be", "start": 391.52, "duration": 3.399}, {"text": "from the place where the will of the", "start": 396.72, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "international community must be", "start": 398.639, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "embodied,", "start": 400.56, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "namely the United Nations itself.", "start": 402.479, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "this very place", "start": 406.4, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "and this very hall particularly.", "start": 408.88, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Reforming", "start": 414.08, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the United Nations system", "start": 415.68, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "is no longer an institutional luxury,", "start": 419.36, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "nor is it a choice that can be postponed", "start": 423.599, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "indefinitely.", "start": 427.28, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "It has become a necessity imposed by the", "start": 429.52, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "profound transformations the world has", "start": 433.199, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "undergone.", "start": 435.44, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "It is imposed by the need for a more", "start": 437.68, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "just international order, an", "start": 441.52, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "international order that is more", "start": 444.08, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "representative and more equitable.", "start": 445.68, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "We cannot ask peoples to trust in", "start": 449.759, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 452.479, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "if its institutions continue to reflect", "start": 455.039, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "the balances of a bygone era.", "start": 457.599, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "We cannot speak of international justice", "start": 462.08, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "without addressing the historical", "start": 466.319, "duration": 3.361}, {"text": "imbalances", "start": 468.16, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "that still mar the structure of", "start": 469.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "international decision making.", "start": 472.319, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Nor can we advocate for international", "start": 476.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "peace and security. While the system of", "start": 478.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "international relations", "start": 481.44, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "continues to favor war", "start": 483.84, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "as a means of resolving dispute.", "start": 488.72, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Accordingly, Algeria calls for", "start": 493.12, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "strengthening the role and the authority", "start": 496.24, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "of the General Assembly. We called for a", "start": 499.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "profound reform of the security council", "start": 502.639, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "that would make it more representative,", "start": 504.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "more equitable, and more effective,", "start": 507.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "and that would put an end to selectivity", "start": 510.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "and double standards in the application", "start": 513.919, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "of international law. In this regard,", "start": 515.919, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "Algeria reaffirms its steadfast support", "start": 518.8, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "for the common African position.", "start": 523.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "We stress that correcting the historical", "start": 526.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "injustice suffered by Africa requires", "start": 529.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "fair, permanent and fair African", "start": 532.32, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "representation in the security council", "start": 534.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "with full powers.", "start": 537.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "If restoring trust begins with", "start": 541.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "institutional reform, then it cannot be", "start": 543.92, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "complete without doing justice to the", "start": 546.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "peoples,", "start": 549.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "aspiring to self-determination", "start": 551.68, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "and the realization of their", "start": 555.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "national", "start": 559.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "projects. The Gulf region", "start": 560.56, "duration": 8.399}, {"text": "and the Middle East region", "start": 564.959, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "are passing through one of the most", "start": 568.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "dangerous periods in their history.", "start": 571.2, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Not only because of the scale of", "start": 574.959, "duration": 3.281}, {"text": "destruction", "start": 576.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "left behind by successive wars, but also", "start": 578.24, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "because of the erosion of the boundaries", "start": 582.64, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "that separate. what is acceptable and", "start": 586.64, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "what must remain rejected and condemned", "start": 589.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "in international relations.", "start": 592.16, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "In this context,", "start": 595.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "my country", "start": 598.48, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "follows with deep concern the continuing", "start": 600.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "escalation in the Gulf region", "start": 603.279, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "where we are witnessing a conflict that", "start": 606.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "is weighing heavily on the states and", "start": 608.64, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "peoples of the region and is undermining", "start": 610.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "their security and stability and", "start": 613.44, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "threatening", "start": 615.6, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "the welfare and development of their", "start": 617.12, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "peoples. peoples that have found", "start": 619.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "themselves hostages, held hostage to", "start": 622.079, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "calculations that are not their own and", "start": 625.44, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "interests that are not their own.", "start": 628.24, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "Algeria", "start": 633.279, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "renews its condemnation", "start": 634.8, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "of the violations of the sovereignty of", "start": 637.92, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "states and their territorial integrity", "start": 640.64, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "in the region. We stress the need to", "start": 644.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "deescalate and respect international law", "start": 646.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "in addressing tensions, disagreements,", "start": 649.68, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "and disputes", "start": 652.32, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "that have", "start": 654.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "taken by storm the region's legitimate", "start": 658.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "aspirations for security, peace, and", "start": 660.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "tranquility.", "start": 663.36, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Algeria also condemns the continued", "start": 665.2, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "Israeli attacks against countries in the", "start": 667.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "region, particularly Syria and Lebanon,", "start": 669.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "and its efforts to divide sisterly", "start": 672.959, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "Somalia.", "start": 675.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "In Palestine, the humanitarian tragedy", "start": 677.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "continues.", "start": 680.56, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "The Israeli occupation", "start": 682.32, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "continues", "start": 684.64, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "to kill Palestinian civilians,", "start": 686.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "including", "start": 689.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "large numbers of women and children in a", "start": 692.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "scene", "start": 695.279, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "in a scene that should never", "start": 697.68, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "become a normalized part of the world's", "start": 701.04, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "daily reality.", "start": 704.8, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "The international community", "start": 708.32, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "and we along with it", "start": 711.36, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "welcomed the ceasefire in Gaza", "start": 715.279, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "that entered into force almost 11 months", "start": 719.2, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "ago.", "start": 722.64, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "We had hoped that it would mark the", "start": 724.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "beginning of a process", "start": 726.32, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "to end the suffering of civilians,", "start": 730.079, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "that it would pave the way towards a", "start": 734.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "lasting political solution.", "start": 736.24, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "That hope quickly faded", "start": 740.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and was extinguished", "start": 743.279, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "in light of the occupying powers", "start": 746.0, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "continued settlement policies and its", "start": 747.68, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "customary disregard for concluded", "start": 752.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "agreements and commitments made.", "start": 755.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "From this podium, Algeria renews its", "start": 759.2, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "full and unconditional support for the", "start": 762.0, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "legitimate and inalienable rights of the", "start": 764.399, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "Palestinian people.", "start": 768.399, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "Fore foremost among them is the", "start": 772.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Palestinian people's natural right to", "start": 774.399, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "establish an independent and fully", "start": 777.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "sovereign state with Al Sharif as its", "start": 779.519, "duration": 6.281}, {"text": "capital", "start": 782.8, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "and if the Palestinian cause", "start": 789.279, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "constitutes", "start": 794.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "a daily test of the credibility of the", "start": 796.24, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "international", "start": 799.76, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "legal system. Africa is yet another", "start": 800.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "test.", "start": 803.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "It is the test of building partnerships", "start": 805.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "that are based on solidarity,", "start": 809.36, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "development, and peace rather than", "start": 811.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "simply managing crisis", "start": 813.36, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and addressing the repercussions without", "start": 817.12, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "giving due attention to the root causes", "start": 820.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "of these crises and their underlying", "start": 823.279, "duration": 5.161}, {"text": "foundations.", "start": 825.44, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Algeria", "start": 828.48, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "is firmly attached to its African", "start": 830.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "identity. It is deeply imbued with a", "start": 832.959, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "culture of peace and dialogue. Algeria", "start": 835.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "will continue to support the just causes", "start": 838.639, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "of the peoples of the continent. Algeria", "start": 841.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "will contribute to every effort that", "start": 844.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "opens to them pathways towards", "start": 847.199, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "stability, development, and integration.", "start": 850.72, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Within this framework, Algeria reaffirms", "start": 854.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "its principal support for the right of", "start": 858.24, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "the people of the Western Sahara to", "start": 860.639, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "self-determination.", "start": 863.199, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "This is based on our firm conviction", "start": 865.76, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "that issues of decolonization cannot be", "start": 870.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "resolved ever", "start": 873.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "through imposing a fat plea or following", "start": 875.44, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "that logic. Rather", "start": 879.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "decolonization ends when people are", "start": 882.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "unable to exercise their rights", "start": 885.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "guaranteed to them under international", "start": 888.48, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "law fully and without any distortion", "start": 890.639, "duration": 10.361}, {"text": "and without any curtailment.", "start": 894.8, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "Algeria welcomes the organization of", "start": 901.12, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "direct negotiations between the two", "start": 903.199, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "parties to the conflict namely the", "start": 905.199, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Kingdom of Morocco and the Policario", "start": 907.04, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "Front. At the beginning of this year,", "start": 909.279, "duration": 5.161}, {"text": "these negotiations were held under the", "start": 914.48, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "opaces of the United Nations and with", "start": 916.079, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "the assistance of the United States of", "start": 918.32, "duration": 4.759}, {"text": "America.", "start": 920.079, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "From this viewpoint,", "start": 923.92, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "allow me to present what we sincerely", "start": 926.48, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and genuinely", "start": 931.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "consider necessary for a lasting and", "start": 934.48, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "just solution to the question of the", "start": 937.279, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "Western Sahara. First,", "start": 939.04, "duration": 4.599}, {"text": "Algeria stresses that the success of the", "start": 943.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "negotiations process requires both", "start": 946.48, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "parties to engage in good faith.", "start": 949.92, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "and with a genuine commitment", "start": 953.519, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "to reaching a political solution that is", "start": 957.04, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "fair, lasting, and mutually acceptable", "start": 961.199, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "away from the logic of dictates and", "start": 965.199, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "bargains.", "start": 969.279, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "Algeria", "start": 971.279, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "also stresses that any serious", "start": 973.36, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "negotiating process", "start": 975.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "can only be conducted properly within", "start": 979.279, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "the framework of the relevant United", "start": 982.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Nations references and with full respect", "start": 984.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "to the organization's longstanding", "start": 987.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "doctrine on decolonization.", "start": 990.0, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "Second, Algeria warns that any attempt", "start": 993.36, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "to circumvent", "start": 998.48, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "this framework of reference or to", "start": 1000.399, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "marginalize those who hold legitimate", "start": 1002.639, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "rights, namely the people of the Western", "start": 1005.6, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "Sahara and their sole legitimate", "start": 1007.199, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "representative, the Politicario front.", "start": 1009.759, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Any such attempt will not contribute to", "start": 1012.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "resolving the conflict. Rather, it would", "start": 1014.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "further complicate it and exagerbate", "start": 1017.12, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "tensions.", "start": 1019.36, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "in a region that is in dire need of", "start": 1023.12, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "stability, reassurance,", "start": 1025.919, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "cooperation and development.", "start": 1028.319, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Third, Azure reiterates in this matter", "start": 1032.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "that", "start": 1035.679, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "it hosts Sahari refugees on its", "start": 1037.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "territory and has done so for over half", "start": 1040.64, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "a century", "start": 1042.4, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "because their land is occupied.", "start": 1045.039, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "because their land is occupied.", "start": 1048.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "This occupation", "start": 1051.52, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "cannot be simply summed up in a refugee", "start": 1053.6, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "issue given the choice to return", "start": 1057.6, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "voluntarily", "start": 1059.679, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "or resettle", "start": 1061.52, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "or integrate with the local hosts.", "start": 1063.84, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "It is a matter that fundamentally", "start": 1068.08, "duration": 6.599}, {"text": "requires", "start": 1071.679, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "the completion of the decolonization", "start": 1076.08, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "process in the Western Sahara through a", "start": 1078.4, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "comprehensive political process.", "start": 1081.919, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Such a process can only be achieved", "start": 1085.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "by the people of the Western Sahara", "start": 1089.039, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "exercising their inherent right to", "start": 1090.88, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "self-determination.", "start": 1092.96, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "This", "start": 1096.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": ">> this is undoubtedly", "start": 1098.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "the correct", "start": 1102.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and proper approach to addressing the", "start": 1105.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "situation of the last colony on the", "start": 1107.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "African continent.", "start": 1109.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "The right of peoples to", "start": 1112.24, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "self-determination", "start": 1114.88, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "remains a fundamental principle of", "start": 1118.24, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "international law.", "start": 1120.24, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "The passage of half a century cannot", "start": 1124.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "transform an imposed reality into a", "start": 1127.679, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "legal fact.", "start": 1130.16, "duration": 7.72}, {"text": "Nor can the passage of a half a century,", "start": 1132.16, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "transform", "start": 1139.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "an imposed reality and a right into a", "start": 1141.2, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "legal fact, or diminish a right whose", "start": 1143.84, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "holders need no one to explain it to", "start": 1146.559, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "them. The collective memory of peoples", "start": 1148.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "such as is the historic experience of", "start": 1151.36, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "the United Nations both confirm that", "start": 1154.0, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "genuine peace is not built by", "start": 1157.52, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "disregarding rights. Rather, it is built", "start": 1160.64, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "through settlements that respect these", "start": 1164.08, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "rights and respond to the aspirations of", "start": 1166.08, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "those who hold these rights.", "start": 1169.76, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "Algeria views the Sahari Sahal region as", "start": 1173.36, "duration": 10.24}, {"text": "a single space where the challenges of", "start": 1178.64, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "security, development and stability", "start": 1183.6, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "intersect.", "start": 1186.96, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "As president of the republic, his", "start": 1188.96, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "excellency abdun has stated,", "start": 1190.96, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "\"Terrorism", "start": 1194.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "cannot be approached through a purely", "start": 1197.28, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "security based method. Nor can poverty", "start": 1200.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and marginalization be effectively", "start": 1203.679, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "tackled in isolation from a security", "start": 1206.0, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "environment that enables terrorist", "start": 1207.76, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "groups and organized crime networks to", "start": 1209.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "expand and spread", "start": 1212.16, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "and take root.", "start": 1215.28, "duration": 8.279}, {"text": "Security and development", "start": 1218.799, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "are not parallel tracks.", "start": 1223.76, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "They are two sides of the same coin.", "start": 1226.48, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "Accordingly,", "start": 1230.32, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "Algeria promotes an approach that is", "start": 1232.799, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "based on supporting the security of", "start": 1234.799, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "states in the region and accompanying", "start": 1237.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "their development efforts and", "start": 1240.559, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "encouraging reconciliation and dialogue", "start": 1242.72, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "and addressing the underlying causes of", "start": 1246.799, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "instability while respecting state", "start": 1248.559, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "sovereignty,", "start": 1251.039, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "their ter territorial integrity and the", "start": 1252.64, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "choices of their people.", "start": 1255.919, "duration": 4.201}, {"text": "As a neighboring and brotherly country", "start": 1260.32, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "and in keeping with its historic", "start": 1265.44, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "commitment to solidarity, Algeria will", "start": 1268.48, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "remain ready to support the countries of", "start": 1270.559, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "the Sahal in confronting security and", "start": 1274.159, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "development challenges. We will extend", "start": 1277.6, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "a hand and support political solutions", "start": 1282.64, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "that preserve the stability of the", "start": 1286.24, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "region and open before its people's", "start": 1288.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "broader horizons for development and", "start": 1291.679, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "progress.", "start": 1293.76, "duration": 5.799}, {"text": "As for sisterly Libya,", "start": 1295.679, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "now in the 16th year of its crisis,", "start": 1300.64, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Libya remains another example that shows", "start": 1304.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "that protracted crisis", "start": 1307.2, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "cannot be resolved by deepening", "start": 1310.24, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "divisions,", "start": 1312.4, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "but rather through dialogue,", "start": 1314.24, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "reconciliation,", "start": 1316.48, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "and the unification of institutions.", "start": 1318.08, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "Algeria renews its support for a", "start": 1322.96, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "peaceful and comprehensive and Libyanled", "start": 1325.039, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "political solution.", "start": 1328.72, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Algeria renews its support for the", "start": 1331.12, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "efforts of the United Nations", "start": 1334.159, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "and our confidence in the United Nations", "start": 1337.679, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "ability to accompany the Libyan people", "start": 1340.32, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "toward a settlement that preserves the", "start": 1342.88, "duration": 2.96}, {"text": "unity of their country and its", "start": 1344.48, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "institutions.", "start": 1345.84, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Only the Libyans can build", "start": 1347.6, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "the consensus needed to safeguard their", "start": 1351.76, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "nation.", "start": 1355.44, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Only the Libyans are entitled to take", "start": 1356.96, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "decisions related to their destiny", "start": 1361.919, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "of their nation and", "start": 1364.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "their future.", "start": 1368.559, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Algeria firmly believes that ending", "start": 1370.88, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "foreign interference", "start": 1373.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "in all its forms and manifestations, be", "start": 1375.52, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "they political, military or security.", "start": 1378.0, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "Ending this is an essential element in", "start": 1383.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "creating the conditions necessary to end", "start": 1386.159, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "division and build a Libyan state that", "start": 1388.96, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "is single and unified and stable. a", "start": 1392.64, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Libyan state that is able to determine", "start": 1395.679, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "its own future", "start": 1397.679, "duration": 6.201}, {"text": "with the will of its people.", "start": 1399.84, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "Based on the same convictions and in", "start": 1405.919, "duration": 3.281}, {"text": "response to the same imperatives,", "start": 1407.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Algeria expresses its steadfast support", "start": 1409.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "for the legitimate authorities in", "start": 1412.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "brotherly Yemen and the Sudan", "start": 1414.88, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "as they both seek to respond to their", "start": 1417.919, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "people's aspirations for security,", "start": 1420.799, "duration": 8.041}, {"text": "stability, unity, and fraternity.", "start": 1424.08, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "This leads us to a truth that cannot be", "start": 1429.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "ignored.", "start": 1433.12, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "Peace cannot be built without", "start": 1435.12, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "development", "start": 1437.039, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "and development cannot flourish without", "start": 1438.799, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "security and stability.", "start": 1441.2, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "And under the leadership of the", "start": 1444.159, "duration": 3.041}, {"text": "president of the republic, Abd Majit", "start": 1445.52, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Tabun, Algeria has chosen to be an", "start": 1447.2, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "active participant", "start": 1449.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "in the changes that the world is", "start": 1452.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "witnessing today, not simply a recipient", "start": 1454.64, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "of these changes. Algeria has chosen to", "start": 1458.72, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "transform challenges into bridges", "start": 1462.24, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "towards progress, to transform its", "start": 1464.159, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "resources into levers for building a", "start": 1467.679, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "productive and diversified economy and", "start": 1472.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "to use knowledge and science as engines", "start": 1475.279, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "of its comprehensive national advice", "start": 1477.6, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "advancement.", "start": 1480.48, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "Algeria has incorporated sustainable", "start": 1482.159, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "development into its national programs", "start": 1484.0, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "and enshrined it in the constitution", "start": 1487.2, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "since 2020.", "start": 1489.2, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "This is based on a vision that is", "start": 1491.039, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "grounded in social justice", "start": 1492.64, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and in economic and environmental", "start": 1496.559, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "sustainability.", "start": 1498.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "It is based on a clear and firm and", "start": 1500.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "unwavering principle that no one should", "start": 1503.6, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "be left behind and that not a single", "start": 1506.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Algerian", "start": 1510.159, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "man or woman", "start": 1512.0, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "should be marginalized in the journey of", "start": 1514.08, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "national development.", "start": 1518.799, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "When presenting its", "start": 1522.08, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "voluntary national review report in July", "start": 1524.48, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "2026, Algeria outlined the progress it", "start": 1527.2, "duration": 8.719}, {"text": "has achieved in implementing the 17 SDGs", "start": 1530.08, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "and the efforts that it has made in that", "start": 1535.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "regard. Efforts that gained their true", "start": 1538.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "substance", "start": 1542.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "when those numbers", "start": 1543.6, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "became", "start": 1546.0, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "tangible improvements in all aspects of", "start": 1547.84, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "life.", "start": 1550.64, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "And this is the essence of development,", "start": 1551.76, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "transforming public policies into", "start": 1555.279, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "tangible dignity that people feel in", "start": 1559.679, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "their daily lives.", "start": 1561.84, "duration": 5.719}, {"text": "And from this understanding", "start": 1563.919, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "of sustainable development,", "start": 1569.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Algeria proceeds", "start": 1572.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "with the conviction that development", "start": 1574.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "cannot be fully complete unless it", "start": 1577.12, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "includes its regional", "start": 1580.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "surroundings and environment and unless", "start": 1582.96, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "it contributes to building a more", "start": 1584.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "integrated African space that is better", "start": 1587.12, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "able to face the present and future", "start": 1590.08, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "challenges.", "start": 1592.4, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "The destiny of the peoples of the", "start": 1594.48, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "continent is interconnected. Their", "start": 1596.96, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "challenges are shared. This makes", "start": 1599.84, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "solidarity and integration in Africa", "start": 1603.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "indispensable pillars of sustainable", "start": 1605.6, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "development.", "start": 1609.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "As we", "start": 1614.48, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "witness the accel accelerating", "start": 1617.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "technological revolution, we cannot", "start": 1619.919, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "accept that Africa would remain on the", "start": 1621.76, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "margins or simply become a consumer of", "start": 1623.84, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "its outputs.", "start": 1628.32, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Here", "start": 1630.4, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "we note the need to invest in the", "start": 1632.0, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "African person to build scientific and", "start": 1635.279, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "digital capacities so that artificial", "start": 1639.6, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "intelligence becomes a tool for", "start": 1642.48, "duration": 3.199}, {"text": "development,", "start": 1644.08, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "not a new", "start": 1645.679, "duration": 4.041}, {"text": "label", "start": 1649.919, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "for another development gap between the", "start": 1651.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "north and the south.", "start": 1653.76, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "We call for", "start": 1656.24, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "a balanced and responsible international", "start": 1659.6, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "regulation of artificial intelligence", "start": 1662.64, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "that would guarantee equitable access to", "start": 1664.64, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "its benefits, that would preserve the", "start": 1666.799, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "sovereignty of states, and that would", "start": 1668.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "transform this revolution into a shared", "start": 1670.559, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "opportunity rather than an exclusive", "start": 1673.52, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "privilege or monopoly in the hands of a", "start": 1676.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "few.", "start": 1678.96, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "In the end, we return to the question", "start": 1681.36, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "where we began.", "start": 1684.72, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "How do we restore trust?", "start": 1687.679, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Trust is restored when words match", "start": 1690.64, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "actions.", "start": 1693.76, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "Trust is restored when the law is", "start": 1695.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "applied equally to all.", "start": 1697.679, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Trust is restored when peoples", "start": 1701.44, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "can see the United Nations as a common", "start": 1705.039, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "home,", "start": 1708.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "a shared home rather than an", "start": 1710.32, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "organization held hostage to the", "start": 1712.96, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "dominance of power politics.", "start": 1714.799, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "Our responsibility today", "start": 1718.159, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "is not to leave to our children a legacy", "start": 1721.84, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "of a world that is burdened with our", "start": 1726.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "crisis. Rather, what we owe them is to", "start": 1728.559, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "leave them a world that is better than", "start": 1731.12, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "the one that we have inherited. Let us", "start": 1732.559, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "move together forward. Not because the", "start": 1735.039, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "path is an easy one, but because the", "start": 1737.279, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "alternative to cooperation", "start": 1739.76, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "is for each of us", "start": 1742.399, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "to face the storms of this era alone,", "start": 1744.96, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "isolated", "start": 1749.2, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "and powerless.", "start": 1752.96, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Let us make the restoration of trust a", "start": 1756.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "process rather than a slogan.", "start": 1759.12, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Let us make multilateralism a reality", "start": 1761.76, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "rather than simply a principle. Let us", "start": 1764.399, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "make the United Nations in this pivotal", "start": 1767.679, "duration": 6.841}, {"text": "moment", "start": 1771.52, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "a space where diplomacy regains its", "start": 1774.72, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "place, where confidence in institutions", "start": 1777.279, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "is restored and where respect for", "start": 1780.64, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "international law becomes a shared", "start": 1783.919, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "commitment rather than", "start": 1786.48, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "a", "start": 1789.52, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "matter of convenience subject to whims.", "start": 1791.039, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Let us work together for a world where", "start": 1794.399, "duration": 3.201}, {"text": "the application of law is not a", "start": 1796.159, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "privilege. In which peace is not merely", "start": 1797.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "the temporary absence of war and in", "start": 1800.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "which development is not reserved for", "start": 1803.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "those who came first but rather a shared", "start": 1806.88, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "right of all peoples with all their", "start": 1809.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "diversity", "start": 1811.52, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "and for all generations to come.", "start": 1813.6, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "This is our responsibility towards our", "start": 1818.96, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "peoples", "start": 1821.76, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "and this is the trust that we must", "start": 1823.279, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "deliver to future generations. I thank", "start": 1826.24, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "you for your kind attention.", "start": 1828.48, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "I thank the Minister of State, Minister", "start": 1836.559, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "of Foreign Affairs, National Community", "start": 1838.799, "duration": 6.681}, {"text": "Abroad and African Affairs of Algeria.", "start": 1840.72, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "I now", "start": 1848.24, "duration": 2.4}]